{"seq":1,"slug":"spare-parts-forecast","title":"备件需求预测与备货","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/spare-parts-global/spare-parts-forecast","wordCount":3090,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"备件需求预测与备货\">备件需求预测与备货</h1><p>一个在东南亚三国销售的电动滑板车品牌，在上市 14 个月后遇到一个反直觉的现象：整车销量开始放缓，但某一款后轮电机的备件需求开始上升。原因是早期批次的车主陆续进入了电机故障的高发期。如果备件计划是跟着整车销量曲线做的，这批需求会完全落在预测之外，而恰恰是这批需求决定了未来半年的维修时效。</p>\n<p>本篇处理的就是这个问题：<strong>备件需求如何被预测，以及预测结果如何转化为多层级的安全库存</strong>。它与通用的需求预测方法共享骨架，但备件的需求对象有三个使常规方法失效的特征——需求由装机量与失效率驱动而非销量驱动、序列呈现间歇性（大量零值）、以及不同备件的关键度差异极大（有无替代、停机会不会导致换新）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>备件的期望需求可以写成一个乘式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[D_{part}(t)] = \\sum_{c} N_{installed}(c, t) \\cdot \\lambda(c, part, t) \\cdot \\left(1 - \\mu_{repair}(part)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是机型批次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{installed}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该批次在保的装机量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是同批次中该备件的失效强度（hazard rate），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{repair}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;能修而不换&quot;的比例。这个乘式有两层含义，都很关键。</p>\n<p>第一层：<strong>装机量是一个随时间演化的存量，不是一个销量数字</strong>。一台 14 个月前售出的设备今天仍然在贡献备件需求，而一台今天售出的设备要等到它的保修期中后段才开始贡献。因此备件预测的第一个输入是<strong>装机量曲线</strong>（installed base），它等于历史销量减去退货、减去已过保、减去已报废，且要按批次分开维护——不同批次的批次质量（batch quality）可能差异极大。</p>\n<p>第二层：<strong>失效率曲线通常是浴盆形或递增的</strong>。新品期的早期失效（early failure）往往由制造缺陷驱动，中期平缓，后期进入磨损期上升。批次质量差异会让这条曲线在不同批次间平移。因此用&quot;经验失效率&quot;这个单一常数去乘装机量，会系统性地高估新品期的需求、低估成熟期的需求。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[历史销量] --&gt; B[装机量曲线&lt;br/&gt;按批次/按市场]&#10;    B --&gt; C[失效率模型&lt;br/&gt;λ batch, part, age]&#10;    D[维修记录: 换件数] --&gt; C&#10;    E[能修不换比例 μ] --&gt; F[备件需求]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[按关键度分级]&#10;    G --&gt; H[多层级安全库存分配]&#10;    H --&gt; I[中央仓 / 区域仓 / 网点]&#10;    I --&gt; J[第三章 3.2 调拨触发]\">graph TD\n    A[历史销量] --&gt; B[装机量曲线&lt;br/&gt;按批次/按市场]\n    B --&gt; C[失效率模型&lt;br/&gt;λ batch, part, age]\n    D[维修记录: 换件数] --&gt; C\n    E[能修不换比例 μ] --&gt; F[备件需求]\n    C --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[按关键度分级]\n    G --&gt; H[多层级安全库存分配]\n    H --&gt; I[中央仓 / 区域仓 / 网点]\n    I --&gt; J[第三章 3.2 调拨触发]</pre><h2 id=\"用维修记录反推真实失效率\">用维修记录反推真实失效率</h2><p>上面的乘式里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是最难估准的一项。可用的观测数据是维修记录里的换件数，但它有两个偏差源必须修正。</p>\n<p><strong>低估偏差：报修率小于 1</strong>。不是每一台故障设备都会被报修——用户在过保后可能自行处理、可能忍耐、也可能直接换新。因此观测到的换件数只是真实失效数的<strong>一个比例</strong>。这个比例（报修率）在保内接近 1，在保外显著低于 1，且随市场与产品价格而变化。修正的方法是给观测值除以一个按市场估计的报修率，而不是直接用观测值。</p>\n<p><strong>滞后偏差：换件发生在失效之后</strong>。从设备失效到备件被消耗，中间有用户报修、检测、派单、维修的延迟。因此用当月换件数去对齐当月装机量会引入一个时间错位，尤其在时效较长的市场里可以错位数周。修正的方法是把换件数按其对应的<strong>设备生产批次与当前机龄</strong>归档，而不是按维修发生的月份归档。</p>\n<p>处理完这两个偏差之后，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 应当被表达为<strong>按机龄的函数</strong>而不是一个常数。工程上通常用分段常数（按机龄 0–3 月、3–12 月、12–24 月、24 月以上分段）或一个 Weibull 形状的曲线。分段常数在数据量不大时更稳健，Weibull 在数据充足时能更好地外推——但要警惕用外推值做采购决策，因为失效率曲线的后段最容易被批次质量事件打破。</p>\n<h2 id=\"间歇性需求的处理\">间歇性需求的处理</h2><p>到了网点或单个 SKU 这一层，备件需求的序列通常表现为间歇性：很多天为零，偶尔为一。这类序列不能直接套用移动平均或指数平滑，因为零值会系统性地把预测压低，而真正的需求信号藏在&quot;何时非零、非零时多大&quot;这两件事里。</p>\n<p>对间歇性需求，标准做法是<strong>分两段建模</strong>：用一次分类模型预测&quot;某天是否有需求&quot;（发生概率），再用一次回归预测&quot;有需求时需求量多大&quot;（条件幅度），两者相乘得到期望需求。这个方法族在通用预测里有完整的讨论，本 hub 不重述其推导，只指出备件场景下的两个具体调整：分类模型的输入应当包含<strong>该网点近期的派单量</strong>（因为需求由派单驱动而非由独立到达驱动），而幅度模型在网点层几乎总是恒等于 1（一次维修消耗一件），因此可以退化成纯概率模型。</p>\n<p>这个退化带来一个实用的简化：在网点层，&quot;需求预测&quot;实际上只需要回答&quot;多久会来一次&quot;，即需求到达率。这个量可以直接从该网点的历史换件记录估计，不需要复杂的模型。复杂性应当被保留在<strong>区域仓与中央仓</strong>这一层，那里的汇总需求近似连续，且需要同时考虑多个网点的汇聚效应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多层级安全库存的分配\">多层级安全库存的分配</h2><p>备件网络通常是三层的：中央仓（集中采购）、区域仓（覆盖若干国家或地区）、网点（最后一公里）。安全库存应当放在哪一层，是一个可以用<strong>汇聚效应与响应时间</strong>来权衡的问题。</p>\n<p>汇聚效应说的是：把库存集中在一个点，所需的<strong>总</strong>安全库存低于分散持有——因为不同网点的需求波动会在汇聚后相互抵消。需求的标准差在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立网点汇聚后只增长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍，而需求量增长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍，所以相对波动下降。响应时间说的是：库存放得越靠近用户，补货提前期越短，所需的安全库存也越少。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>汇聚程度</th>\n<th>补货提前期</th>\n<th>适合持有的件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中央仓</td>\n<td>全球</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>跨国运输 3–8 周</td>\n<td>高价低频、需统一检测或编程的件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域仓</td>\n<td>数国</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>区域运输 3–10 天</td>\n<td>中频件、多网点共享的件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网点</td>\n<td>单点</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>本地调拨 1–2 天</td>\n<td>高频件、小而便宜的件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>安全库存的公式形态是通用的：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS = z \\cdot \\sigma_{LT} \\cdot \\sqrt{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标服务水平对应的分位数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{LT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单位时间需求的标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是补货提前期。备件场景下的三个调整是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{LT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应当来自间歇需求模型（波动主要来自发生概率而非幅度）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 在跨境层有极大方差（清关抽检），应当用高分位而非均值；以及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 应当按<strong>备件关键度</strong>分层设定，而不是全局统一。</p>\n<p>关键度分级的维度有两组：<strong>可替代性</strong>（这个件坏了能不能用其它方式恢复功能，例如整块主板替换一个烧毁的电容）与<strong>后果严重性</strong>（缺件的后果是延迟几天，还是导致整机报废或触发换新）。一个既不可替代、缺件后果又严重的件（例如某型号的专用电源模块），即使需求很低也应当持有相对更高的服务水平；而一个可替代且后果轻微的件（例如外壳螺丝）可以按较低的服务水平持有。这把安全库存从&quot;按需求量分配&quot;变成了&quot;按需求 × 关键度分配&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"备货的批次与生命周期风险\">备货的批次与生命周期风险</h2><p>备件还有一个销售库存没有的风险：<strong>它的需求会随着装机量的自然衰减而消失，而备件本身有保质期或固件兼容期</strong>。这带来两个决策。</p>\n<p><strong>一次性采购 vs 持续补货</strong>。对于生命周期短的消费电子，最优策略往往是在产品生命周期中段做一次<strong>最后一次采购</strong>（last time buy），采购量覆盖产品退市后的整个服务期。这个量的估计要考虑：剩余装机量、剩余保修期分布、以及在服务期结束时故意接受更高的缺货率（因为此时缺件可以引导到换新或升级）。把它当成一个持续补货问题去解，会导致在生命周期末端持续采购一款即将无人使用的零件。</p>\n<p><strong>技术过时</strong>。一个备件的可用性不只取决于它有没有库存，还取决于<strong>有没有能力安装它</strong>——如果该机型的维修设备被淘汰了，有件也没用。因此备货决策要与第一章的能力规划一起看：一批备件的持有期不应超过它能被安装的期限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与调拨-分派的接口\">与调拨、分派的接口</h2><p>本篇产出的预测与安全库存参数，直接决定第三章第 2 篇的调拨触发条件（何时该从区域仓补货到网点）与第二章的分派可行性（备件可达性）。两个接口需要明确。</p>\n<p><strong>调拨的触发</strong>应当基于&quot;库存位置 + 覆盖天数&quot;（days of supply）而不是固定阈值：当某网点的某件覆盖天数低于其补货提前期时触发补货，具体调拨规则见 <a href=\"parts-transfer-network\">跨网点/跨国备件调拨</a>。覆盖天数的计算要用本篇的到达率估计。当某网点的某件覆盖天数低于其补货提前期时触发补货。这个规则比&quot;低于 3 个就补&quot;更能适应不同网点的需求速度差异。</p>\n<p><strong>分派的可行性判定</strong>需要的是&quot;某个具体时点是否可达&quot;（第一章的四个状态，见 <a href=\"../service-network-capacity/spare-parts-availability\">网点备件可用性</a>），这与&quot;平均是否有货&quot;不是一回事。因此预测层的输出应当同时给出<strong>服务水平曲线</strong>（例如&quot;该件在未来 7 天内可达的概率是 0.85&quot;），供分派器在承诺时效时使用。这就把预测的置信度直接泄漏到了对用户的承诺里，是这条链最需要谨慎的一处：给用户的承诺应当基于高置信的分位，而不是基于均值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[装机量曲线] --&gt; B[按机龄的失效率 λ]&#10;    C[维修记录 - 报修率修正] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D[需求到达率 per 网点]&#10;    D --&gt; E[覆盖天数规则]&#10;    E --&gt; F[触发区域仓补货 → 3.2]&#10;    D --&gt; G[服务水平曲线]&#10;    G --&gt; H[分派承诺时效 → 2.1]&#10;    I[备件关键度分级] --&gt; J[分层 z 值]&#10;    J --&gt; K[多层级安全库存]&#10;    K --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    A[装机量曲线] --&gt; B[按机龄的失效率 λ]\n    C[维修记录 - 报修率修正] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D[需求到达率 per 网点]\n    D --&gt; E[覆盖天数规则]\n    E --&gt; F[触发区域仓补货 → 3.2]\n    D --&gt; G[服务水平曲线]\n    G --&gt; H[分派承诺时效 → 2.1]\n    I[备件关键度分级] --&gt; J[分层 z 值]\n    J --&gt; K[多层级安全库存]\n    K --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>备件需求由<strong>装机量与失效率</strong>驱动，而不是销量：预测的第一个输入是按批次维护的装机量曲线，第二个是按机龄的失效率曲线（浴盆形或递增）。</li>\n<li>用维修记录估计失效率必须先修正两个偏差：<strong>报修率小于 1</strong>（保外尤其显著）导致的低估，与<strong>换件滞后于失效</strong>导致的时间错位。</li>\n<li>间歇性需求应<strong>分两段建模</strong>（发生概率 × 条件幅度）；在网点层幅度恒为 1，可退化成纯到达率估计，复杂性集中到区域仓与中央仓。</li>\n<li>多层级安全库存的核心权衡是<strong>汇聚效应 vs 响应时间</strong>；备件场景的三项调整是：波动来自间歇模型、跨境提前期用高分位、服务水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 按<strong>备件关键度</strong>（可替代性 × 后果严重性）分层。</li>\n<li>备件有销售库存没有的<strong>生命周期风险</strong>：中段做&quot;最后一次采购&quot;覆盖服务期，且备件持有期不应超过它被安装能力的有效期。</li>\n<li>对下游的两个接口：调拨触发用<strong>覆盖天数 vs 补货提前期</strong>而非固定阈值；分派承诺应基于<strong>服务水平曲线的高分位</strong>，让预测置信度正确泄漏到用户承诺里。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"备件需求预测与备货","id":"备件需求预测与备货"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用维修记录反推真实失效率","id":"用维修记录反推真实失效率"},{"level":2,"text":"间歇性需求的处理","id":"间歇性需求的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"多层级安全库存的分配","id":"多层级安全库存的分配"},{"level":2,"text":"备货的批次与生命周期风险","id":"备货的批次与生命周期风险"},{"level":2,"text":"与调拨、分派的接口","id":"与调拨-分派的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨境寄修网点路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/service-dispatch/cross-border-service-route"},"next":{"title":"跨网点/跨国备件调拨","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/spare-parts-global/parts-transfer-network"}}